id: retractable-limbs
name: Retractable Limbs
order: 15
grantsUnique: physical-retreat
description: >
  You have the innate ability to retract vulnerable parts of your body, making you less prone to injury. (inspired by the Homebrew from Idios of the DBU Discord)
text: >
  Retractable Limbs: You have the innate ability to retract vulnerable parts of your body, making you less prone to injury. (inspired by the Homebrew from Idios of the DBU Discord)
  (1)-[Passive]: Increase your Defense Value by 1(bT) while below the Injured Health Threshold.
  (2)-[Passive]: Gain access to the Physical Retreat Unique Ability.
  (3)-[Triggered, 1/Round]: If you successfully avoid or otherwise take 0 Damage from an Opponent’s Called Shot, you may use the Basic Attack Maneuver as an Out-of-Sequence Maneuver.

---

[passive]
# (1) Injured or Critical.
if (belowThreshold("injured")) {
    defenseValue += 1(bT);
}
# (2) Its header's `grantsUnique`, free, gone with it.
# (3) An Opponent's Called Shot missed or for no Damage: the Basic Attack offered on its card, out of sequence, once a Round (chat.mjs).
allow retractable.counter;
